The Eternal Pulse is patron to doctors and necromancers alike -- any who wish to stymie life's natural progression find a model in the Pulse. Due to the stigma around undeath, no country can be seen that devotes itself wholeheartedly to the Pulse. Still, her followers are welcomed as guests of other faiths due to their invaluable knowledge and insight.

:::fields
Category :: Outer God
Edicts :: Heal wounds and treat sicknesses, pursue undeath
Anathema :: Sacrifice your life, abandon the wounded or dying
[[Divine Raiment]] :: Coppery, oxidized
[[Celestial Prescence]] :: Red lightning
:::


### Devotee Benefits

:::fields
Divine Ability :: Strength or Constitution
Divine Font :: harm or heal
Divine Sanctification :: can choose holy or unholy
Divine Skill :: Medicine
Favored Weapon :: [morningstar](https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=363)
Domains :: [freedom](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=77), [healing](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=78), [nothingness](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=114), [pain](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=87), [soul](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=118), [undeath](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=97)
Cleric Spells :: 1st: [grim tendrils](https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1548), 2nd: [false vitality](https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1523), 7th: [mask of terror](https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1595)
:::
